WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.220
OPENING

01:05.130 --> 01:06.990
You bastard!

01:17.810 --> 01:19.670
Not bad.

01:19.670 --> 01:21.110
Wait.

01:25.680 --> 01:27.270
Master!

01:28.520 --> 01:30.220
If they're riding around
in a conspicuous truck like that,

01:30.220 --> 01:32.580
I'm sure they're not here to steal from the fields.

01:32.690 --> 01:34.180
But...

01:34.920 --> 01:37.050
You must be Shuzou Chikura.

01:37.360 --> 01:40.560
Let's see now... Have we met before?

01:44.300 --> 01:45.990
It can't be!

01:48.840 --> 02:02.210
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi tobitate tsubasa de

01:48.840 --> 01:55.450
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

01:55.450 --> 02:02.220
Take flight on wings

02:16.560 --> 02:19.730
Morokute nigai kajitsu no you ni

02:16.570 --> 02:19.740
Like fragile but bitter fruit

02:19.730 --> 02:22.940
Hito no kokoro o miryou suru no

02:19.740 --> 02:22.950
It fascinates people's hearts

02:22.940 --> 02:26.040
Togi sumasareta shiroi yubi de

02:22.950 --> 02:24.450
The shadow that manipulates

02:24.450 --> 02:26.050
With sharpened fingers gleaming white

02:26.040 --> 02:29.210
Ayatsuru kage wa chi no kaori

02:26.050 --> 02:29.220
Smells of blood

02:29.210 --> 02:42.210
Shizumi aseta kodou o yobi samasu shi no sasayaki

02:29.220 --> 02:35.660
The whisper of Death

02:35.660 --> 02:42.220
That awakens fading heartbeats

02:43.190 --> 02:49.560
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi

02:43.200 --> 02:49.570
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

02:49.560 --> 02:55.800
Tobitatsu no wa gin no tsubasa

02:49.570 --> 02:55.810
Silver wings take flight

02:55.800 --> 03:02.280
Fukai kaze ni tsume o tatete

02:55.810 --> 03:02.280
Become the power that tears at deep winds

03:02.280 --> 03:12.010
Kirisaku chikara to nare

03:02.280 --> 03:12.020
With poised claws

03:13.000 --> 03:16.190
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

03:16.960 --> 03:20.300
Episode 5
Duet

03:22.760 --> 03:25.330
How could you just retreat like some coward?

03:25.330 --> 03:30.400
Jin and Joe... And even Shiba joining forces
was something we didn't anticipate.

03:31.440 --> 03:34.840
You must've been able to predict
that Shiba was alive.

03:36.980 --> 03:40.720
Failing a second time is not an option.
Recapture Venus.

03:40.720 --> 03:41.650
You got that?

03:41.650 --> 03:42.840
Yes, sir!

03:44.490 --> 03:45.990
Any news on the Ishin?

03:45.990 --> 03:48.460
Nothing of note yet.

03:48.460 --> 03:52.860
Go through all the Revinus vehicle data
from the past few days.

03:52.860 --> 03:54.230
Yes, ma'am.

03:56.630 --> 03:57.930
Vice-Commander.

03:58.870 --> 03:59.920
Yes?

04:01.100 --> 04:03.640
That time...

04:03.640 --> 04:05.040
Why did you miss?

04:18.950 --> 04:22.180
It's unusual for someone of your caliber to miss.

04:22.920 --> 04:25.090
It's just that the helicopter was unstable.

04:25.530 --> 04:27.050
Are you sure that's all?

04:27.530 --> 04:29.360
What are you trying to say?

04:30.670 --> 04:33.570
Nothing. If that's what you say...

04:42.080 --> 04:43.680
Hey, come on!

04:43.680 --> 04:45.650
Come on, come on! What's wrong?!

04:45.650 --> 04:48.410
Are you really pushing or what?!
Put your back into it!

04:49.680 --> 04:51.170
I'm next!

05:07.700 --> 05:09.800
A dojo in a place like this?

05:09.800 --> 05:11.270
Even among the Revinus,

05:11.270 --> 05:14.210
there are some youths who haven't yet
lost their energy to live.

05:14.840 --> 05:18.150
Before I even realized it, this had
become a gathering place for them.

05:18.150 --> 05:20.980
Yeah, we've got one too...
Someone with no energy...

05:21.320 --> 05:23.840
Is he like your bodyguard?

05:24.290 --> 05:25.620
He's a friend.

05:25.620 --> 05:28.420
He may not look it, but he's
as sharp as a drawn sword.

05:31.260 --> 05:35.200
I met Toraji through our involvement with swords.

05:35.200 --> 05:39.190
He may seem a bit odd, but he can be trusted.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.800
How did you meet Toraji?

05:41.800 --> 05:44.970
No, for that matter, how did Sana end up
with you in the first place?

05:45.910 --> 05:48.580
Um... Who are you?

05:48.580 --> 05:50.880
How do you know me?

05:50.880 --> 05:53.110
Don't you remember, Sana?

05:53.110 --> 05:55.210
I'm your grandfather.

05:55.620 --> 05:56.450
That's a lie!

05:56.450 --> 05:58.920
It's not a lie.

05:59.220 --> 06:02.420
I know your father really well.

06:02.420 --> 06:03.860
Papa?

06:09.960 --> 06:15.240
I was asked by Dr. Nobuto to protect Sana.

06:15.240 --> 06:16.370
Jin!

06:16.370 --> 06:19.770
My papa... You knew my papa?!

06:20.070 --> 06:22.310
Why didn't you say anything before?

06:22.310 --> 06:25.800
I didn't mean to hide it. It's just that...

06:56.410 --> 07:00.620
I may not look it anymore, but I was originally
in the genetic engineering field.

07:00.620 --> 07:04.450
Although compared to Dr. Nobuto,
I was nothing to brag about...

07:06.190 --> 07:07.480
Sana.

07:09.290 --> 07:11.290
She must be tired.

07:11.290 --> 07:13.760
Would you like to lie down for a little bit?

07:13.760 --> 07:15.230
Yeah...

07:22.040 --> 07:25.070
Is it true that South Hitachi was destroyed?

07:25.070 --> 07:27.840
Shh! Keep it down.

07:27.840 --> 07:31.180
There's no mistake about the report. It's a shame...

07:31.510 --> 07:33.680
The military has stepped up its activities.

07:33.680 --> 07:37.650
It's because the moderate faction
of Logos has been wiped out.

07:37.650 --> 07:40.620
If only Councilor Tsurusawa
hadn't fallen from power...

07:40.620 --> 07:43.220
There's no sense bringing that up now.

07:43.220 --> 07:47.700
I'm sure that was a scheme devised by
the current organization anyway.

07:47.700 --> 07:49.700
What shall we do, Assistant Instructor?

07:49.700 --> 07:51.700
At this rate, even this place will be...

07:51.230 --> 08:09.220
GOD IS IN
TECHNIQUE

07:51.700 --> 07:55.240
We won't make any progress hiding out
in a place like this.

07:55.240 --> 07:58.870
We should be seriously thinking about
joining forces with Satsuma.

07:58.870 --> 08:02.710
Even the central military has a hard time
meddling with them.

08:02.810 --> 08:06.150
Assistant Instructor, isn't Mr. Kaneda right?

08:06.150 --> 08:09.520
Besides, we've got an adequate supply
of equipment here too, so...

08:09.520 --> 08:12.920
Don't be impatient. As the master said,
refrain from hasty action.

08:24.930 --> 08:28.270
She's resting in my study. Don't worry.

08:28.270 --> 08:29.570
Thank you.

08:29.570 --> 08:30.970
I don't blame her.

08:30.970 --> 08:33.880
All of a sudden, she meets an old man
claiming to be her grandfather,

08:33.880 --> 08:35.930
and then you spring your news on her, too...

08:37.350 --> 08:42.040
You said that you were looking for me
before Toraji even suggested it.

08:42.250 --> 08:49.720
I heard from Dr. Nobuto that you are the father
of Mrs. Nobuto, Sana's late mother.

08:49.720 --> 08:52.560
When did you meet Nobuto?

08:52.560 --> 08:56.000
A little while ago. Right around
the time he was killed.

08:57.430 --> 09:00.130
Oh yes, that incident...

09:01.400 --> 09:07.340
Only valuables were stolen and his lab
was left practically untouched.

09:07.340 --> 09:10.900
No matter how you looked at it,
it appeared to be a simple burglary.

09:11.650 --> 09:16.720
The next day, the illegal firearms that had been
appearing in Revinus markets were discovered.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.780
Everything fell into place too nicely.

09:19.520 --> 09:23.060
I assume you know about Nobuto's research too?

09:23.060 --> 09:25.620
You mean the Vulcan Project?

09:26.490 --> 09:32.090
Our country isn't the only one that was hoping
that the Vulcan Project would be a success.

09:32.700 --> 09:37.770
No matter how I look at it, I find it hard to
believe that it was just a burglary.

09:37.770 --> 09:39.640
Do you know anything about it?

09:39.640 --> 09:41.630
Unfortunately, no.

09:41.880 --> 09:45.810
When you met Nobuto,
did he say anything to you?

09:45.810 --> 09:48.180
Can you fill me in on the details?

09:48.820 --> 09:50.750
Let go of me! I said, let go!

09:50.750 --> 09:51.650
Let go!

09:51.650 --> 09:52.710
Take that!

09:55.690 --> 09:57.120
Who the hell are you?

09:57.120 --> 10:00.230
I'm telling you, I wasn't eavesdropping!

10:00.230 --> 10:02.860
Then what the hell were you doing over there?

10:03.600 --> 10:07.130
I told you, I just wanted
some potatoes from the field.

10:07.300 --> 10:09.000
Hey, you over there!

10:09.000 --> 10:13.110
Seeing how you moved last night,
you're no amateur!

10:13.110 --> 10:16.130
If you're a spy, I can't just let you go.

10:16.980 --> 10:19.680
Hold on! I'm not done talking!

10:19.680 --> 10:22.480
Hey, how about taking me on?

10:43.400 --> 10:45.110
Hey, wait a minute!

10:45.110 --> 10:48.280
Hey, what are you doing?!
He could be a spy, you know!

10:48.280 --> 10:50.440
No, he's a little odd,

10:50.440 --> 10:53.140
but strangely enough,
there's nothing hidden in his stance.

11:09.930 --> 11:11.600
Phantom?

11:11.600 --> 11:13.730
Are you saying that you were in Phantom?

11:14.570 --> 11:18.160
I used my involvement with Phantom
to get close to Dr. Nobuto.

11:18.670 --> 11:20.210
What do you mean by that?

11:20.210 --> 11:22.510
Shortly before he was killed,

11:22.510 --> 11:26.710
Dr. Nobuto was making preparations
to get Sana out of the country.

11:26.710 --> 11:31.080
However, Phantom had already gotten
hold of this information.

11:35.360 --> 11:38.560
Even if my plans to defect have been leaked,

11:38.560 --> 11:41.400
I cannot just stay here and do nothing.

11:41.400 --> 11:44.200
In that case, I will protect your daughter.

11:44.200 --> 11:45.470
What?

11:45.470 --> 11:49.140
As a member of Phantom, I will be able to do it.

11:49.140 --> 11:52.570
So you're going to betray Phantom?
If you did something like that...

11:52.570 --> 11:54.100
I'm well prepared for that.

11:56.140 --> 12:00.150
You're saying you would go that far
to reach that goal of yours?

12:00.150 --> 12:04.250
In return, if your plans to defect are successful,

12:04.250 --> 12:07.020
I would like to ask for your help.

12:09.120 --> 12:11.490
You already know the rest.

12:11.490 --> 12:13.160
The doctor was murdered,

12:13.160 --> 12:17.930
but due to the expectations of the other country,
the defection was carried out according to schedule.

12:17.930 --> 12:19.190
And then...

12:19.700 --> 12:22.800
Just when we were relieved
to have recovered Sana...

12:22.800 --> 12:26.070
The Commander of Phantom,
aware of our betrayal, attacked us.

12:32.010 --> 12:32.850
No!

12:32.850 --> 12:35.210
I'll protect you at all costs, Sana!

12:35.680 --> 12:37.310
Let's get outta here, Joe!

12:45.030 --> 12:48.290
We somehow managed to get Sana out safely.
It was a close call.

12:49.500 --> 12:53.770
And then, hoping to get the information you no
longer had access to because of Nobuto's death,

12:53.770 --> 12:56.030
you decided to come here.

12:57.510 --> 12:59.340
Your instincts aren't bad.

12:59.340 --> 13:02.570
I did, in fact, receive Nobuto's personal effects.

13:03.140 --> 13:05.650
You said your name is Jin Tsurusawa, right?

13:05.650 --> 13:06.580
Yes.

13:06.580 --> 13:08.980
Are you by any chance
Councilor Tsurukawa's son?

13:09.880 --> 13:11.990
I see something of a resemblance.

13:11.990 --> 13:13.090
Yes.

13:13.090 --> 13:14.460
Just as I thought.

13:14.460 --> 13:17.950
In that case, I have a vague idea of
what your intentions are.

13:19.590 --> 13:22.660
Is what you want the power to take revenge?

13:22.660 --> 13:26.500
The research papers I inherited
from Nobuto are in this room.

13:26.500 --> 13:28.440
I don't mind if you look through them.

13:28.440 --> 13:29.870
Are you sure?

13:29.870 --> 13:32.640
It's not that I completely trust you yet,

13:32.640 --> 13:35.610
but the fact remains that you did save Sana's life.

13:35.610 --> 13:38.210
But let me tell you this.

13:38.210 --> 13:42.120
For your own sake, don't think of doing
anything foolish like taking revenge.

13:42.120 --> 13:45.420
Because eventually, it'll only trip you up.

13:56.760 --> 13:58.030
Sana...

14:03.970 --> 14:06.940
She's been wanting to play for some time now.

14:08.010 --> 14:10.910
She must really love the piano.

14:15.980 --> 14:19.820
I'm sorry Sana, for not telling you
about your father.

14:19.820 --> 14:22.990
That's okay, Jin. I was just
a little surprised, that's all.

14:22.990 --> 14:24.660
No matter what reasons you had,

14:24.660 --> 14:27.660
you're still the one who saved me.

14:27.660 --> 14:28.500
Sana...

14:28.500 --> 14:31.530
But Jin, please tell me.

14:31.530 --> 14:34.370
What are you trying to do?

14:38.040 --> 14:40.510
I had the greatest respect for my father.

14:40.510 --> 14:42.610
Your father?

14:42.610 --> 14:44.680
My father was a politician.

14:44.680 --> 14:45.910
He was popular,

14:45.910 --> 14:47.850
he had achieved a fairly high status,

14:47.850 --> 14:49.520
and he was powerful.

14:49.520 --> 14:53.620
But he might've been too honest for a politician.

14:53.620 --> 14:55.290
He had a lot of enemies.

14:55.290 --> 14:57.620
If you're honest, you make enemies?

14:58.760 --> 15:01.960
That's just the way things are
in the world of politics.

15:02.600 --> 15:06.900
Those people plotted against him
and he was brought down.

15:06.900 --> 15:08.340
Brought down?

15:08.340 --> 15:11.630
He lost his political position.

15:12.640 --> 15:15.700
And then... he killed himself.

15:19.480 --> 15:22.080
I think my father was weak,

15:22.080 --> 15:26.720
but at the same time, I can never forgive those
who drove him into a corner.

15:26.720 --> 15:28.450
Jin...

15:31.760 --> 15:34.490
Jin! Can I be useful to you somehow?

15:35.630 --> 15:38.200
There must be something about me, right?

15:38.200 --> 15:41.940
I must have something and that's why
everyone's chasing me, right?

15:41.940 --> 15:44.000
Even I can figure that out!

15:44.000 --> 15:45.560
Sana...

15:45.970 --> 15:50.140
If that will be useful to you, then I...

15:52.050 --> 15:55.170
Thank you. But...

15:56.920 --> 15:59.940
This isn't something you should get involved in.

16:00.350 --> 16:01.620
Jin.

16:02.460 --> 16:04.690
But I do appreciate how you feel, Sana.

16:19.840 --> 16:22.000
What are you doing, eavesdropping like that?!

16:22.840 --> 16:25.810
My, for a little kid, you sure are
interested in boys, aren't you?!

16:27.150 --> 16:28.140
Honestly!

16:28.450 --> 16:31.850
Boy, that hurt. Who would throw a rock that big?

16:32.390 --> 16:36.550
Look at you! Still lying around like that!

16:36.620 --> 16:40.990
Joe, you must know, right?
That Jin's out for revenge...

16:41.760 --> 16:44.130
That's pretty interesting stuff, isn't it?

16:44.130 --> 16:46.470
I wish he'd told me earlier.

16:46.470 --> 16:49.460
So who's he planning to take revenge on?

16:51.110 --> 16:53.870
Hey, come on, tell me! Come on, come on!

16:53.870 --> 16:54.780
I don't know.

16:54.780 --> 16:56.180
Really?

16:56.180 --> 16:57.640
I don't care who it is.

16:57.640 --> 16:59.710
If Jin says he'll do it, then I will too.

16:59.710 --> 17:00.870
That's all there is to it.

17:01.720 --> 17:02.840
Hmph...

17:29.580 --> 17:30.800
Hey!

17:33.350 --> 17:35.440
Are you from Revinus?

17:37.320 --> 17:41.520
I'm from Logos. I had a pretty nice life there.

17:41.520 --> 17:44.190
But I didn't realize that the ones
at the bottom of the social scale

17:44.190 --> 17:46.630
were sacrificing their lives
so that I could live that way.

17:46.630 --> 17:51.930
Hmph! Even if they do realize it,
those from Logos just pretend they don't.

17:52.200 --> 17:54.940
That's a pretty shrewd observation
you made there, kid.

17:54.940 --> 17:57.440
Well, that might've been true.

17:57.440 --> 18:02.310
But at least the ones who are here
have realized that,

18:02.310 --> 18:04.910
and want to do something about
the current situation.

18:04.910 --> 18:06.680
Who asked you?!

18:06.680 --> 18:10.320
Believe it or not, we Revinus
are quite happy, you know!

18:10.320 --> 18:11.920
If that's the case, then it's fine.

18:11.920 --> 18:15.990
But there are those who
want to climb out of that too.

18:15.990 --> 18:17.080
Dammit! Get outta here!

18:23.430 --> 18:25.800
If you feel like it, come to the dojo.

18:25.800 --> 18:29.330
It's nice to have a bunch of friends
you can trust, you know.

18:31.870 --> 18:34.270
Why don't you go, Gora?

18:34.270 --> 18:38.750
Y-You kiddin' me? I can't stand stuffy guys!

18:38.750 --> 18:41.510
Man, it's making me itchy!

18:42.180 --> 18:44.120
Wait, wait! My food!

18:44.120 --> 18:46.710
Hey, wait! Food! My food!

18:47.620 --> 18:48.880
Vice-Commander.

19:06.970 --> 19:09.470
Just as I thought. It's not here.

19:30.730 --> 19:32.160
Jin!

19:49.380 --> 19:51.870
Jin, you can play?

20:12.770 --> 20:13.970
What's the matter?

20:13.970 --> 20:16.700
It's a little out of tune.

20:17.310 --> 20:18.150
Out of tune?

20:18.150 --> 20:19.170
Yes.

20:21.010 --> 20:22.680
See? Can't you tell?

20:22.680 --> 20:26.150
No, but you have an amazing ear for sound, Sana.

20:26.150 --> 20:29.180
Here. And here, too.

20:30.090 --> 20:33.290
If we hadn't played together,
I wouldn't have noticed.

20:33.290 --> 20:37.800
But the high and low notes are
slightly off in the same way.

20:37.800 --> 20:39.070
In the same way?

20:39.070 --> 20:42.900
Yeah, I didn't know they could be off like that.

20:43.870 --> 20:45.240
Sana?

20:45.470 --> 20:47.840
Could you play that piece
you were playing yesterday?

20:47.840 --> 20:49.440
Yesterday?

20:49.440 --> 20:51.240
Sure.

21:36.260 --> 21:39.280
Jin, I feel a little funny...

21:46.170 --> 21:47.790
Jin?

21:53.740 --> 21:54.800
Sana!

22:25.140 --> 22:29.650
Nagai kioku no hate ni

22:25.140 --> 22:29.610
If at the end of our long memory

22:29.610 --> 22:35.450
Time will tear us apart

22:29.650 --> 22:35.480
Toki ga bokura o wakatsu nara

22:37.490 --> 22:44.130
If at the end of my sweet memory with you

22:37.520 --> 22:44.160
Kimi to amai kioku no hate ni

22:44.130 --> 22:50.430
You and I become one again

22:44.160 --> 22:50.470
Mata bokura hitotsu nara

22:50.430 --> 22:57.610
From a quietly stretched arm's length away

22:50.470 --> 22:57.640
Sotto te nobashita kyori kara

22:57.610 --> 23:02.310
I will search for the meaning

22:57.640 --> 23:02.350
lmi o sagasu kara

23:02.310 --> 23:08.150
Can you hear it? The words dance in midair

23:02.350 --> 23:08.190
Kikoeru? Kotoba ga chuu ni mau

23:08.150 --> 23:13.960
We shall meet when our wish is granted

23:08.190 --> 23:13.990
Kanaeta toki ni deau

23:13.960 --> 23:17.630
Leaving only their reverse behind

23:13.990 --> 23:17.660
Reverse dake nokoshite

23:17.630 --> 23:21.030
The torn words

23:17.660 --> 23:21.060
Chigireta kotoba

23:21.030 --> 23:27.160
Blurred time and light

23:21.060 --> 23:27.200
Kasureta jikan to hikari

23:29.340 --> 23:33.670
I have found them now

23:29.370 --> 23:33.710
lma, mitsuketa kara

23:35.260 --> 23:45.860
<b><i>Next Episode</i></b>

23:44.920 --> 23:47.820
Next time on Innocent Venus:

23:47.440 --> 23:50.650
Episode 6
Rampage

23:47.820 --> 23:49.320
"Rampage"
